don't worry.

777
00:59:48,889 --> 00:59:49,857
It's important that we have
one with him.

778
00:59:49,890 --> 00:59:52,226
[Marisa] Of course.
Come on.

779
00:59:52,259 --> 00:59:56,864
[guests chattering]

780
