Take your dollars and stuff them
in your filthy pockets and

789
01:01:02,429 --> 01:01:06,700
pray, just pray, that I never
catch you snooping around again.

790
01:01:10,437 --> 01:01:14,909
I know how this feels, maybe
better than you do.

791
01:01:14,942 --> 01:01:17,978
I've been missing him my whole
life, you know that.

792
01:01:18,580 --> 01:01:20,214
I know what he's like.

793
01:01:25,719 --> 01:01:28,989
