795
01:01:32,661 --> 01:01:35,429
Marcos makes everything
else disappear.

796
01:01:38,933 --> 01:01:39,934
Cold.

797
01:01:41,636 --> 01:01:42,803
Pain.

798
01:01:45,706 --> 01:01:46,941
Loneliness.

799
01:01:50,811 --> 01:01:52,012
Everything.

800
01:01:56,283 --> 01:01:58,919
Nothing could get to me
while I was there.

801
01:02:01,222 --> 01:02:03,891
Wrapped in his warmth.

802
01:02:06,026 --> 01:02:16,770
And you know, I think we could
have a few good years left.

803
01:02:20,307 --> 01:02:24,078
You are the most dignified
woman I've ever met.

804
01:02:24,111 --> 01:02:28,349
-[upbeat music]
-[indistinct chattering]

805
01:03:19,466 --> 01:03:23,404
But-but now she's yours so you
can call her whatever you want.

806
01:03:23,437 --> 01:03:28,442
I'm very fond of her, I had to
break the amniotic sac myself

807
01:03:28,475 --> 01:03:32,313
as she was coming out because
her mother was really struggling

808
01:03:32,346 --> 01:03:33,347
with the during labor.

809
01:03:33,380 --> 01:03:36,584
Yeah, Papa say you're quite
the veterinarian.

810
01:03:36,618 --> 01:03:41,822
Yes, I remember that you used
to love our horses.

811
01:03:41,855 --> 01:03:45,426
I know, I used to love going
to the stables with you.

812
01:03:45,459 --> 01:03:48,062
[laughing]

813
01:03:48,095 --> 01:03:52,166
[upbeat music continues
in background]

814
01:03:56,503 --> 01:04:00,274
[guests chattering indistinctly]

815
