that chest.

872
01:10:13,581 --> 01:10:16,851
And Daniel Demetrius was rubbing
the walls with bleach?

873
01:10:16,884 --> 01:10:18,318
And you bolted up his door?

874
01:10:18,351 --> 01:10:22,557
I tried to mold him, to change
him, tried to make

875
01:10:22,590 --> 01:10:26,094
