Everyone needs my permission.

920
01:12:44,665 --> 01:12:47,201
All that shit
from your past is over.

921
01:12:47,235 --> 01:12:51,739
Your Englishman and I are going
to come to an agreement today.

922
01:12:52,940 --> 01:12:55,776
No one is going
to announce anything to anyone.

923
01:12:57,311 --> 01:13:00,248
Everything's going to be fine,
and you're going to be happy,

924
01:13:00,281 --> 01:13:02,817
no matter how
much you insist otherwise.

925
01:13:04,451 --> 01:13:06,419
And that Forster guy,

926
01:13:07,889 --> 01:13:08,890
