927
01:13:12,425 --> 01:13:15,096
I know you'd rather it'd be me
than Daniel.

928
01:13:18,498 --> 01:13:22,303
That boat trip,
right after Mom died.

929
01:13:22,336 --> 01:13:23,604
Do you remember?

930
01:13:24,505 --> 01:13:25,907
Me and Danny,

931
01:13:25,940 --> 01:13:29,010
