away because you killed her.

932
01:13:29,043 --> 01:13:34,215
Oh, I'm fed up with you women,
all my life surrounded by

933
01:13:34,248 --> 01:13:39,520
crazy women, bitter women, with
insane thoughts in their head.

934
01:13:39,553 --> 01:13:42,256
I never regret being unfaithful
