[Patrick] Don't just stand
there, get me some activated

1037
01:25:32,466 --> 01:25:34,669
charcoal for a nasal gas tube.

1038
01:25:35,737 --> 01:25:38,472
One gram per kilo,
let's go with 50 for now.

1039
01:25:39,373 --> 01:25:42,110
Maybe we'll do it after.

1040
01:25:42,142 --> 01:25:43,243
[Patrick] Have you
ever done that?

1041
01:25:43,276 --> 01:25:44,612
[Kostas] Not, for years.

1042
01:25:44,646 --> 01:25:48,248
[metal clanging]

1043
01:25:48,281 --> 01:25:50,317
[Patrick] Okay, first
things first.

1044
01:25:50,350 --> 01:25:51,986
A stomach pump, quickly!

1045
01:25:52,020 --> 01:25:53,921
[rustling]

1046
