[door closes]

1050
01:27:02,990 --> 01:27:06,594
[wind blowing]

1051
01:27:09,831 --> 01:27:10,832
[door opens]

1052
01:27:21,109 --> 01:27:22,677
What is this place, Marcos?

1053
01:27:22,710 --> 01:27:23,778
What have you done?

1054
01:27:24,946 --> 01:27:26,848
Oh, my God.

1055
01:27:28,281 --> 01:27:29,717
It's gonna be all right.

1056
01:27:30,852 --> 01:27:32,252
It's gonna be all right.

1057
01:27:34,088 --> 01:27:35,857
Everything is gonna
be all right.

1058
01:27:40,327 --> 01:27:41,629
Oh, my baby.

1059
01:27:46,768 --> 01:27:50,605
[water sloshing]

1060
01:27:53,306 --> 01:27:56,811
[indistinct music playing]

1061
01:28:09,456 --> 01:28:11,092
[camera shutter clicks]

1062
01:28:11,125 --> 01:28:16,496
[indistinct background music]

1063
01:28:19,267 --> 01:28:20,535
