1064
01:28:20,568 --> 01:28:25,338
[background music continues]

1065
01:28:28,776 --> 01:28:30,878
[ship horn blows]

1066
01:28:34,782 --> 01:28:36,684
She's stable now.

1067
01:28:36,717 --> 01:28:40,054
Still unconscious,
but it's all right now.

1068
01:28:43,624 --> 01:28:48,596
Sofia's pregnant, I want you
to take the baby away.

1069
01:28:48,629 --> 01:28:50,998
You have to do it now.
It's the best moment.

1070
01:28:52,834 --> 01:28:53,835
Now's the time.

1071
01:28:53,868 --> 01:28:57,538
When she recovers,
we'll tell her she lost it.

1072
01:29:00,274 --> 01:29:01,843
End of story.

1073
01:29:01,876 --> 01:29:03,511
You've really gone mad.

1074
01:29:03,544 --> 01:29:08,015
No, you don't understand,
I'm doing it for her.

1075
01:29:09,717 --> 01:29:12,987
If you don't do it,
the other guy will.

1076
01:29:13,020 --> 01:29:17,992
In fact, in 15 minutes,
he has orders to start.

1077
01:29:18,025 --> 01:29:18,960
