And just to make sure you also
call this village quack over.

1080
01:29:32,372 --> 01:29:36,476
I don't know you, Marcos,
or maybe I do.

1081
01:29:36,510 --> 01:29:38,613
I just don't like you anymore.

1082
01:29:38,646 --> 01:29:42,316
Would you stop being a prissy
fucking faggot for once

1083
01:29:42,350 --> 01:29:43,551
in your life?

1084
01:29:47,989 --> 01:29:49,257
Poor Marcos.

1085
01:29:49,290 --> 01:29:51,592
Sofia is not pregnant.

1086
01:29:53,794 --> 01:29:55,930
[Patrick] You raised a real
Timoleon, I'm afraid.

1087
01:29:56,530 --> 01:29:58,232
She's just like you.

1088
01:29:58,266 --> 01:30:00,400
A sweet-talking manipulator.

1089
01:30:01,168 --> 01:30:03,037
Jesus, what a mess.

1090
01:30:06,841 --> 01:30:08,943
