we see each other.

1091
01:30:08,976 --> 01:30:10,011
Good.

1092
01:30:10,044 --> 01:30:12,479
Fuck you, Marcos.

1093
01:30:12,513 --> 01:30:15,149
I just hope you can forgive
yourself one day.

1094
