1104
01:32:32,286 --> 01:32:33,287
Papa?

1105
01:32:37,825 --> 01:32:39,827
Have you done something to me?

1106
01:32:45,299 --> 01:32:46,901
What have you done to me?

1107
01:32:49,070 --> 01:32:53,174
Sweetie, I don't think it's
okay for you to get up.

1108
01:32:54,208 --> 01:32:55,576
