1109
01:33:01,215 --> 01:33:07,621
Seven weeks ago, I found
out I was pregnant.

1110
01:33:10,424 --> 01:33:12,226
It was a beautiful thing.

1111
01:33:14,728 --> 01:33:16,931
It really was a beautiful thing.

1112
01:33:19,568 --> 01:33:22,303
Hmm, but then I lost it.

1113
01:33:24,539 --> 01:33:26,941
I lost a baby.

1114
01:33:29,143 --> 01:33:35,416
I didn't tell Ian
because I hoped that I would

1115
01:33:35,449 --> 01:33:38,986
