♪ I'm just a soul
whose intentions are good ♪

1136
01:37:12,534 --> 01:37:17,304
♪ Oh Lord, please don't let me
be misunderstood ♪

1137
01:37:22,677 --> 01:37:27,582
♪ Oh Lord, please don't let me
